OL,5,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FRetired politician Martin and
OL,7,     Fhousekeeper Tracey like to keep
OL,8,     Fthings traditional at Elmfield B&B
OL,9,     Fin Devon. But their guests are
OL,10,     Funimpressed by the ageing
OL,11,     Fheirlooms.
OL,12,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FLeoni and Tish treat their rivals
OL,14,     Fto chocolate-themed rooms and
OL,15,     Fchocolate breakfasts, at The
OL,16,     FChocolate Box in Bournemouth. But
OL,17,     Fthe DIY drinks don't go down well.
