OL,5,G1650 American Pickers
OL,6,     FBackroad Barnstorming: On a
OL,7,     FConnecticut farm, the picking is
OL,8,     Ffast and furious. And in one of
OL,9,     Fthe biggest barns they've ever
OL,10,     Fseen, the guys find ultra-rare
OL,11,     Fskis for a Ford Model T.
OL,12,G1750 The Dog House Australia
OL,13,     FKelpie Tess could be the perfect
OL,14,     Ftraining companion for
OL,15,     Feight-year-old Sophie. And Lolla
OL,16,     Fmight be the right big, goofy dog
OL,17,     Fthat tai chi instructor Amanda
OL,18,     Fneeds.
