OL,11,     Fplace.
OL,12,G0010 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FThe medics help Mick, who's put
OL,14,     Finto an induced coma after going
OL,15,     Finto cardiac arrest on a tennis
OL,16,     Fcourt, and fell-runner Michael,
OL,17,     Fwho's been seriously injured by
OL,18,     Fcows in Cumbria.
